cloud-architecture-diagram
direction right
colorMode pastel
styleMode plain
typeface clean

Users [icon: users, label: "Recruiters and Hiring Team"]
GitHub [icon: github]

AWS [icon: aws, color: orange] {
  Edge {
    CloudFront [icon: aws-cloudfront]
    WebBucket [icon: aws-simple-storage-service, label: "React SPA"]
  }

  Identity {
    Cognito [icon: aws-cognito]
  }

  VPC [icon: aws-vpc] {
    Public {
      ALB [icon: aws-elb-application-load-balancer]
      NAT [icon: aws-vpc, label: "NAT Gateway"]
    }

    Private {
      API [icon: aws-fargate, label: "Spring Boot API"]
      Worker [icon: aws-fargate, label: "Spring Boot Worker"]
    }
  }

  Async {
    Queues [icon: aws-simple-queue-service, label: "SQS and DLQs"]
    Scheduler [icon: aws-eventbridge]
  }

  Storage {
    Files [icon: aws-simple-storage-service, label: "Resumes and Offers"]
    Registry [icon: aws-elastic-container-registry]
  }

  Messaging {
    SES [icon: aws-simple-email-service]
  }

  SecurityOps {
    Secrets [icon: aws-secrets-manager]
    KMS [icon: aws-key-management-service]
    Observability [icon: aws-cloudwatch]
    Audit [icon: aws-cloudtrail]
  }
}

External {
  Supabase [icon: database, label: "Supabase PostgreSQL\nFree demo / paid production"]
  GoogleIdentity [icon: google, label: "Google OAuth"]
  GoogleCalendar [icon: calendar, label: "Google Calendar"]
  Grok [label: "xAI Grok API\npreferred when funded"]
  Gemini [icon: google-gemini, label: "Gemini API\noptional fallback"]
}

Users > CloudFront
CloudFront > WebBucket: Static assets
CloudFront > ALB: /api/*
ALB > API
API > Cognito: Verify identity
Cognito <> GoogleIdentity
API <> Supabase: TLS session pooler
API > Files: Presigned access
API > Queues: Transactional outbox
Queues > Worker: Async work
Worker <> Supabase: TLS session pooler
Worker <> Files
Worker <> GoogleCalendar
Worker > Grok: Resume assessment
Worker --> Gemini: Optional fallback
Worker > SES: Email
Scheduler > Worker: Reconciliation and retention
GitHub > Registry: Build images
Registry > API, Worker
API, Worker > Secrets, KMS
API, Worker > Observability, Audit

legend [position: bottom-left] {
  [connection: >, label: Synchronous]
  [connection: -->, label: Asynchronous]
  [color: orange, label: AWS boundary]
}
